00:16:15.457 --> 00:16:16.964
Oh yes, clothes

270
00:16:21.831 --> 00:16:24.715
Because things keep happening like I'm dreaming

271
00:16:24.715 --> 00:16:26.475
I might get it wrong for a moment

272
00:16:27.048 --> 00:16:30.826
We'll see each other often in the next few weeks
Let’s get acquainted with it more.

273
00:16:31.306 --> 00:16:32.240
After getting the contact information

274
00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:35.248
I was struggling there and even performed a one-man show.

275
00:16:35.248 --> 00:16:38.217
I really want to call him, I really want to hear his voice

276
00:16:39.662 --> 00:16:41.422
It’s really embarrassing Luo Aijun

277
00:16:41.893 --> 00:16:44.768
You don't need to worry at all, right?

278
00:16:44.760 --> 00:16:47.640
Ah yes thank you

279
00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:48.964
Thank you for your hard work

280
00:16:56.488 --> 00:16:57.733
Sure enough

281
00:16:59.115 --> 00:17:01.791
Is it better to stay in fantasy?

282
00:17:15.384 --> 00:17:17.186
(sedative)

283
00:17:23.124 --> 00:17:24.395
-Thank you for your hard work, brother -Yeah

284
00:17:25.568 --> 00:17:29.133
Brother, I’ll have a chat with the producer and then come back.

285
00:17:29.942 --> 00:17:32.142
Ouch, it feels like it's going to take a long time

286
00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:34.448
You get on the bus first

287
00:17:34.448 --> 00:17:35.857
-我知道了 -好

288
00:17:39.675 --> 00:17:41.577
(Luo Aijun)

289
00:17:50.933 --> 00:17:52.488
Hello

290
00:17:53.546 --> 00:17:56.555
I... am Luo Aijun

291
00:17:56.555 --> 00:17:57.786
i know

292
00:17:58.315 --> 00:17:59.911
Please tell me

293
00:17:59.911 --> 00:18:02.968
The clothes I borrowed from you haven't been returned yet

294
00:18:02.968 --> 00:18:04.848
May I ask where you are now?

295
00:18:17.222 --> 00:18:20.093
Give you your clothes

296
00:18:23.177 --> 00:18:25.622
You can return it to me next time you shoot

297
00:18:26.284 --> 00:18:27.435
But still…

298
00:18:28.915 --> 00:18:30.124
Also

299
00:18:31.662 --> 00:18:32.551
this

300
00:18:33.484 --> 00:18:36.582
I saw what you put in your pocket

301
00:18:36.582 --> 00:18:39.924
I'm afraid that pretending not to see it will make you even more unhappy.

302
00:18:45.422 --> 00:18:46.431
good

303
00:18:49.262 --> 00:18:51.791
Then we'll see you next time we shoot

304
00:18:54.720 --> 00:18:55.760
That...

305
00:19:00.626 --> 00:19:04.204
I think it's a bit over the line to say that.

306
00:19:04.204 --> 00:19:06.466
I was still hesitating whether to say it or not.

307
00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:10.937
Because you looked tired during the shoot

308
00:19:10.937 --> 00:19:13.400
That's when you hint to me

309
00:19:17.586 --> 00:19:20.097
what do you mean

310
00:19:22.835 --> 00:19:24.648
Like you don't eat or something like that

311
00:19:24.648 --> 00:19:27.342
Maybe you are like this

312
00:19:27.342 --> 00:19:29.933
But you sometimes look unhappy...

313
00:19:31.293 --> 00:19:33.528
If I think too much

314
00:19:33.528 --> 00:19:34.582
Then I'm sorry

315
00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.328
I said the wrong thing

316
00:19:38.328 --> 00:19:40.364
Who are you? Why are you talking so much?

317
00:19:40.364 --> 00:19:41.600
That's right

318
00:19:42.137 --> 00:19:44.102
Because I have neurogastritis

319
00:19:44.102 --> 00:19:46.102
It’s hard to eat during filming

320
00:19:46.831 --> 00:19:49.266
Since the drink attack three years ago

321
00:19:49.266 --> 00:19:52.124
The company decided to throw away all outside food

322
00:19:52.742 --> 00:19:55.026
-So... -But

323
00:19:55.026 --> 00:19:57.746
You said I look glum sometimes

324
00:19:59.284 --> 00:20:01.302
That's not because I'm in bad shape

325
00:20:01.857 --> 00:20:02.728
what

326
00:20:04.226 --> 00:20:05.355
Otherwise...

327
00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:08.973
It’s because of you, Teacher Luo Aijun

328
00:20:10.888 --> 00:20:11.924
what

329
00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:19.048
Please tell me what did I do wrong?

330
00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:24.604
After exchanging contact information, I also sent you a message first.

331
00:20:25.791 --> 00:20:27.564
But you didn't reply

332
00:20:28.195 --> 00:20:33.013
Are you trying to draw a clear line with me?

333
00:20:33.622 --> 00:20:34.893
Me?

334
00:20:37.835 --> 00:20:39.973
Please give me some advice for today’s shooting.

335
00:20:41.022 --> 00:20:42.506
How dare I...

336
00:20:42.506 --> 00:20:44.448
Don’t reply to the messages sent by your life.

337
00:20:46.066 --> 00:20:48.373
I didn't mean it

338
00:20:48.373 --> 00:20:50.857
It seems that I didn’t notice it when I was busy working.

339
00:20:51.022 --> 00:20:54.480
It’s true. How could I not reply to your message?

340
00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:57.391
So things are not as expected

341
00:20:57.391 --> 00:20:59.733
Makes me feel bored and lost

342
00:21:00.133 --> 00:21:04.160
So I didn’t look at your face all day today

343
00:21:05.275 --> 00:21:11.880
But how can someone like you feel disappointed with me?

344
00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:15.004
I'm very...how should I put it?

345
00:21:15.395 --> 00:21:17.253
Can't quite understand

346
00:21:17.253 --> 00:21:20.084
I've made it so clear

347
00:21:20.084 --> 00:21:21.706
You still don’t understand?

348
00:21:33.244 --> 00:21:35.666
You don't seem to hate me

349
00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:42.600
I'm flirting now

350
00:21:45.893 --> 00:21:47.542
Flirting with Teacher Luo Aijun

351
00:21:49.906 --> 00:21:53.466
From the first time we met until now, I have always loved you...

352
00:21:54.151 --> 00:21:58.235
Very interested

353
00:22:05.574 --> 00:22:10.746
"My idol is chasing me?!"

354
00:22:10.942 --> 00:22:12.902
Kuisheng said he wanted to break up with me

355
00:22:12.902 --> 00:22:16.031
I don't know what to do

356
00:22:16.031 --> 00:22:18.706
You can't treat Brother Zhu He like this

357
00:22:18.706 --> 00:22:20.897
We can't treat Brother Zhu He like that

358
00:22:20.897 --> 00:22:23.662
He said he did have a new partner

359
00:22:23.662 --> 00:22:26.346
Do you want to meet today?

360
00:22:26.346 --> 00:22:30.408
I am very interested in Teacher Luo

361
00:22:30.786 --> 00:22:32.297
Please…

362
00:22:33.182 --> 00:22:35.364
Do you have a date?

